WEBVTT

00:01.080 --> 00:06.720
Thank you for Your Majesty's reward I don't need anything only Xu'er.

00:07.120 --> 00:10.120
Has always wanted to ask Your Majesty for a teacher.

00:13.320 --> 00:16.960
Xu'er who do you want as your teacher?

00:17.040 --> 00:18.760
Need me to personally ask?

00:20.520 --> 00:21.920
Your son.

00:24.240 --> 00:27.160
Your son has always admired Zhu Yuanzhi grand General Zhu.

